    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "So Samson confiscated Yulia's phone and sent her to wash the dishes, while back at City Hall Pasha phoned the governor to brag that he was shredding the archive folder so the blind would never see it. Next time we'll return to the communal flat, where Marina comes home to find her room wrecked. See you next time!",
